The binary shipped in this project's images is built from official release
v1.11.0, commit e42ae7ab8107201e64e52ee024824e8cab3683b3 of
https://github.com/versity/versitygw.

 1. No upstream source or dependency manifest is modified. Release v1.11.0 already
    includes golang.org/x/net v0.62.0; the former v1.8.0 dependency patch is removed.
 2. The compiler is Go 1.27.4, using golang:1.27.4-bookworm pinned to image-index
    digest sha256:4fa7c968ba93f1635670522dbb01a2c78150443e1385746924566079f36570ea.
    This includes the crypto/x509 fix for GO-2026-6809 (CVE-2026-111943) and the
    net/http fix for GO-2026-6859.
 3. Version metadata identifies v1.11.0, the commit above and its UTC commit time.
    CGO is disabled, dependencies use go.sum and -mod=readonly, and automatic
    Go toolchain downloads are disabled.

The build is described in docker/versity/Dockerfile and app/backend/Dockerfile
(storage-init target). The official runtime image and entrypoint are not used;
Acta retains its existing unprivileged Node/Debian wrapper and POSIX sidecar layout.
Dependency license sources are inventoried in docs/STORAGE-DEPENDENCY-LICENSES.csv.
